From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jxlarrea <jx@jxl.me>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:11:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ARM64: configs: crown: Leave the git state out of the kernel
 version

The image's layer is applied to the kernel as uncommitted changes, so the
git state setlocalversion appends only ever says -dirty. The build names
the kernel after the release instead, through LOCALVERSION.
---
 arch/arm64/configs/crown_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/crown_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/crown_defconfig
index a405567..e82a2aa 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/crown_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/crown_defconfig
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 CONFIG_CROSS_COMPILE="aarch64-linux-android-"
+# CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO is not set
 # CONFIG_FHANDLE is not set
 CONFIG_MEMCG=y
 CONFIG_MEMCG_SWAP=y
